<title>AUSTRIA: Austria '95 trade deficit narrows to 88 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria '95 trade deficit narrows to 88 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian central statistics</p>
<p>office reported on Friday the following final trade figures for</p>
<p>1995.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN TRADE BALANCE	 1995	 1994</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance  -88.0 bln -116.4 bln</p>
<p> Exports			  580.0 bln  512.5 bln</p>
<p> Imports			  668.0 bln  628.9 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - The release of trade data was delayed due to adjustments in accounting standards necessary after Austria joined the European Union at the beginning of 1995. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 253</p>
</text>
